// El flujo F emite 0 vehículos por período: spawn tiene que ser positivo.
simulation S { duration 1 h }
intersection A at (0 m, 0 m)
intersection B at 100 m east of A
intersection C at 100 m east of B
road AB from A to B
road BC from B to C
route R = A -> B -> C
flow F along R { spawn 0 every 10 s }
